# SHA-256 of the release artifact each plugin version installs.
# Updated by the release process; the bootstrap REFUSES to install anything
# whose hash is not listed here or does not match.
#
# Why this file exists: rekol's pitch is "no API key, nothing leaves your
# machine, audit the repo instead of piping a script into your shell". An
# install path that downloads and executes an unverified tarball on first run
# contradicts exactly that — and would be a fair hit from the audience we want.
